{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "4ecd2dae0f7db490aa967e434c6d143563de7886e01c5d470ea2b2b090a1e9aa", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}ちゃん、\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "欸欸，小{$P$}、\n小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "555f125bdc5d04752f5ca33e7184971749ed7abba94fc253d8a9acd50d024bd8", "ja": "こないだの茜ちゃんのゾンビクイーン、チョー\nスゴかったでしょ？　生き生きとした演技で！", "zh": "前阵子小茜演僵尸女王的时候，\n那活生生的演技是不是超厉害的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c303213cc9cb1663c7bc38dbf079474b9b6bc2614ff87f6f116eafb5ae3a5aea", "ja": "ゾンビなのに生き生きとしてたらダメだろ……。\nまあ、楽しそうで良かったけど。", "zh": "明明是僵尸，活生生的怎么行……\n不过你好像演得很开心，这样就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "03599bdd6996da62ef16ee94db0b6c91e29c50a5fdce495dac0b66961d17e672", "ja": "そうそう、楽しければなんでもオッケー。ところで\n{$P$}ちゃん、ごほうびはマダかね？", "zh": "没错没错，只要开心就万事OK。话说回来，\n小{$P$}还不打算给小茜奖励吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "50297b89552411d51b0e7351ad7bc11d4d31d3acc494ad198f87aac059c5af79", "ja": "ガンバッた茜ちゃんには、ごほうびがあるべき。\nじゃなきゃ、今からずっと周りでスキップし続けるよ？", "zh": "对于努力的小茜，就该给予奖励。\n不然小茜从现在开始会在你旁边一直跑跳步喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7e539252fb45ea75168c7de6f5dd5c7c678543f2ae79d19968d166560084a2b3", "ja": "落ち着かないから、やめてくれ……。\nごほうびなら、あるから。ほら、新しい仕事だ！", "zh": "别这样，你会害我会静不下心的……\n要奖励的话当然有。你看，就是新的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "caf20cb46828d8a770a7868a39dae51a56e432e7c25e3e086a5ecf278ff6f666", "ja": "ん～っ！　惜しいな～{$P$}ちゃん！\nそれも嬉しい！　嬉しいけど、違うんだよなあ～。", "zh": "嗯～！真可惜啊～小{$P$}！\n那也很让人高兴！虽然高兴，但不对啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e48f957eb69136c24dbc956f64f81641f5274cb3c72bedc63ad6c6fa42120533", "ja": "それじゃあ……あっ！　プリンが欲しいのか。\n冷蔵庫に1個残ってるから食べていいぞ。", "zh": "那么……啊！你想要布丁是吗。\n冰箱里还剩一个，你可以拿去吃喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "e36312555a62e419712faadced866fbd7d9451e06581767b2e07d65f480c6951", "ja": "えっ、ホントに！？　やったー！", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？太棒了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "50bbe5734d2521c9b1de79d0916b2727f6db3a6cac7b9def3f797fd0aea7d12c", "ja": "……い、いやいや！　茜ちゃんにはオヤツ与えとけばい\nいとか思ってる？　ねえ、思ってる？　それは違うよ！", "zh": "……不、不对不对！你是不是觉得只要给小茜点心\n就可以交差？你真的这么想吗？那就大错特错了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "0c145b7db9c595e76c11597f2159cbf108dfda6b76ace5da4a34ddb632970784", "ja": "ほら～、茜ちゃんといえばナデナデ、ナデナデといえば\n茜ちゃんでしょ！？　さあさあ、早く早く！", "zh": "来～说到小茜就想到摸头，说到摸头\n就想到小茜对吧！？来吧来吧，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d7915547f5650e9edfbdad67f58c73e69926aca87f8d78eacddacc984f89c285", "ja": "なんだ、そんなことでいいのか？\nほら……、よく頑張ったな、茜。", "zh": "什么啊，只要这样就好了吗？\n来吧……你很努力呢，茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0043_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "77df920f8a789905f1b082ea2a973da67bd608a487aec67c57b911ab80f13eb5", "ja": "ニャハハ、サンキュー{$P$}ちゃん！\nじゃ、茜ちゃんはプリン食べてきます。さらばなのだ！", "zh": "喵哈哈！谢啦，小{$P$}！\n那么，小茜要去吃布丁了。再见啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
